{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"combo-f-nav","type":"text","text":"# 玩家普攻｜第04批代码冻结，专项回归通过\n[[计划_玩家普攻连段]] · [[GGYGO_结构_玩家普攻连段.canvas|结构]] · [[GGYGO_流程_AbilitySystem.canvas|主流程]]\n第二轮完整 C++ 构建已通过；第五次自动化中 Combo 两项与 MontageTask 共 3/3 通过且 0 warning。真实引擎 Mesh、CVar 优先级保存/恢复及具体 lease owner 夹具已验证。GA/动画接线和完整动作仍待验收。","x":0,"y":0,"width":1510,"height":145,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"combo-f-start","type":"text","text":"1. 首次按下 → ActivateAbility\n先初始化本地激活代次，再调用 Super。\n校验 → Commit → StartStep(0)。\n同步回调返回均核对代次。\n忽略激活键的已按下状态。","x":0,"y":250,"width":450,"height":260,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"combo-f-main","type":"text","text":"2. StartStep(i) → Main\n关旧 Trace/窗口，解绑旧任务。\nTask 保存实际有效速率，ASC 播放。\nReady 后核对激活/段/任务身份。\nMain → End；watchdog 仅作异常兜底。","x":530,"y":250,"width":450,"height":260,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"combo-f-input","type":"text","text":"3. WaitComboInput → HandleInputPressed\n发送 SourceStep + RequestId，先消费 GAS 事件。\n拒绝旧请求号、错误段、已关窗或终段。\n否则刷新唯一 Pending 与有效期。\nTryAdvanceCombo()","x":1060,"y":250,"width":450,"height":260,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"combo-f-window","type":"text","text":"4. NotifyState → HandleMontageEvent\n无 ASC: 预览静默返回，游戏世界警告。\n有 ASC: Task 验 Montage/实例/所有权，GA 验主 Mesh。\nBegin → 开窗并 TryAdvanceCombo。\nEnd → 关窗、清缓存、拒绝待处理请求。\nHitWindow 独立且服务器判定。","x":1060,"y":650,"width":450,"height":260,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"combo-f-branch","type":"text","text":"5. TryAdvanceCombo\nif 开窗 && Pending未过期 && next有效:\n  消费 Pending → StartStep(next)\nelse: 保持 Main/End\n每请求最多推进一段。","x":530,"y":650,"width":450,"height":260,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"combo-f-end","type":"text","text":"6. 没有合法后续请求\nMain → End → OnCompleted → EndAbility。\n第三段不循环。\n下次按下重新激活第一段。","x":0,"y":650,"width":450,"height":260,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"combo-f-clean","type":"text","text":"结束 / 中断 / 取消\n先过 GAS 有效性与 ScopeLock 门禁。\n清旧 Trace/窗口/任务/Timer、恢复 Mesh。\n全部任务委托解绑，TaskOwnerEnded。\n最后 Super；广播后不写实例。\n延期 End 也校验原激活代次。","x":530,"y":1040,"width":450,"height":260,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"combo-f-correct","type":"text","text":"权威确认 / 拒绝\nSendAuthoritativeStep → ASC ClientCorrectAbilityState。\nASC 筛 Spec/活动实例/key，转发通用载荷。\nCombo 校验确切类型/范围/Revision。\n纠正 StartStep 后再核对激活与段。\n联机与引擎嵌套播放限制见计划。","x":1060,"y":1040,"width":450,"height":300,"color":"3"}
	],
	"edges":[
		{"id":"combo-fe-start","fromNode":"combo-f-start","fromSide":"right","toNode":"combo-f-main","toSide":"left","label":"StartStep(0)"},
		{"id":"combo-fe-input","fromNode":"combo-f-main","fromSide":"right","toNode":"combo-f-input","toSide":"left","label":"活跃期的新按下"},
		{"id":"combo-fe-window","fromNode":"combo-f-input","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"combo-f-window","toSide":"top","label":"接收动画窗口"},
		{"id":"combo-fe-eval","fromNode":"combo-f-window","fromSide":"left","toNode":"combo-f-branch","toSide":"right","label":"检查请求"},
		{"id":"combo-fe-next","fromNode":"combo-f-branch","fromSide":"top","toNode":"combo-f-main","toSide":"bottom","label":"合法下一段"},
		{"id":"combo-fe-end","fromNode":"combo-f-branch","fromSide":"left","toNode":"combo-f-end","toSide":"right","label":"不满足 → 默认收尾"},
		{"id":"combo-fe-clean","fromNode":"combo-f-branch","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"combo-f-clean","toSide":"top","label":"取消/播放失败"},
		{"id":"combo-fe-finish","fromNode":"combo-f-end","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"combo-f-clean","toSide":"left","label":"自然完成清理"},
